  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Development: Family Farming Diversification, Integrated Markets, Nutrition and Climate Resilience Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#xBF;s overarching goal is to sustainably increase the income and dietary
diversity of rural households in the country&#xBF;s eastern and northern regions. Its
development objective is to provide assistance for family farming diversification
and adaptation to CC to increase access to markets and dietary diversity in the
Bafat&#xE1;, Cacheu, Gab&#xFA; and Oio regions, in alignment with IFAD&#xBF;s Country Strategy
Note (CSN), while fostering entrepreneurship among rural youth and women,
persons with disabilities and migrants who have returned to the country and their
integration into regional and subregional trade corridors. The project will directly
contribute to the achievement of United Nations Sustainable Development Goals
